upstream revision.

The drawings in 20/ and 24/ are the Material Symbols Outlined style at weight
400 and grade 0, in the 20 px and 24 px optical sizes.

The files are unchanged; src/ui/glyph.tsx copies the path data across verbatim,
so what a page draws is what upstream drew. SHA256SUMS records the checksum of
every file, and src/ui/symbols.test.ts verifies both the checksums and that the
inline path data still matches these files.

